From 17f59b4645f51dc8d620c4e9b4f618972f6333e7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 23:16:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] base: Add GameSpace support

Port of the crDroid 17.0 GameSpace framework support:
- 5c0bee650d4 core: adding support for game space (rmp22, from AxionOS)
- 2133c5519ab services: Treat gamespace apps as games (rmp22)
- cd8470b5b68 services: Add toggle for gamespace auto detect apps
  (Pranav Vashi)

GameSpaceService tracks the focused app on the default display and
starts io.chaldeaprjkt.gamespace's SessionService when a game from
gamespace_game_list comes to the front, and stops it when the game
leaves or the keyguard shows. While a game is active, full screen
intents are suppressed in SystemUI.

Adapted to AOSPA: the hooks sit next to AOSPA's own code (no
AxSandboxService here), and the bypass-charge path in
GameStateDispatcher is dropped since it needs the LineageOS SDK
HealthInterface, which AOSPA doesn't ship.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
